OL,3,GNEWSADeputy calls for clarity on
OL,4,Aapplications backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has called for figures
OL,7,Fshowing the scale of a backlog of
OL,8,Fpopulation management applications to
OL,9,Fbe made public.
OL,11,FIn recent months the Population
OL,12,FManagement Office has faced criticism
OL,13,Fover application waiting times and its
OL,14,Fdirector, who left his role after it
OL,15,Femerged he was based in the UK.
OL,17,FDeputy Rob Curgenven said the office
OL,18,Fhad previously said staff were "working
OL,19,Fhard to reduce the backlog", but said
OL,20,Fthat was "not itself a measurable
OL,21,Foutcome".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
