OL,3,GNEWSADeputy calls for clarity on
OL,4,Aapplications backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has submitted written questions
OL,7,Fasking Home Affairs president deputy
OL,8,FMarc Leadbeater how many applications
OL,9,Fare outstanding, how long they are
OL,10,Ftaking to process and what is being
OL,11,Fdone to tackle delays.
